1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:00,540
W: Hello.

2
00:00:01,180 --> 00:00:02,320
This is Cindy Wells.

3
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:08,020
I've got an appointment with a dentist tomorrow at 3:30 p.m., but I'm in lots of pain.

4
00:00:08,780 --> 00:00:10,955
Is it possible to see someone today?

5
00:00:11,440 --> 00:00:13,100
M: I'm sorry to hear that, Ms. Wells.

6
00:00:13,880 --> 00:00:16,520
According to the schedule, we have one open slot today.

7
00:00:17,220 --> 00:00:21,160
It's at 1:00 p.m. However, it won't be with your regular dentist.

8
00:00:21,985 --> 00:00:22,600
W: That's fine.

9
00:00:23,050 --> 00:00:24,860
I don't believe I can wait until tomorrow.

10
00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:28,920
M: Okay, I'll go ahead and cancel your Tuesday appointment then.

11
00:00:29,560 --> 00:00:31,580
Oh, could you please bring your insurance card?

12
00:00:32,275 --> 00:00:33,160
W: Why do you need it?

13
00:00:33,585 --> 00:00:35,040
I thought you already had my records.

14
00:00:36,440 --> 00:00:40,245
M: We're upgrading the computer system today, so we can't go online until tomorrow.
